  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1804.01 Apiary Inspection. Every year, the inspector shall inspect apiaries, bees, and equipment for evidence of any pests of honey bees if the beekeeper makes a request for inspection or if there is suspicion of the presence of a regulated pest.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Agr 1800) #5802, eff 3-25-94, EXPIRED: 3-25-00\n\nNew. #7284, eff 5-24-00, EXPIRED: 5-24-08\n\nNew. #10586, eff 5-13-14; ss by #13978, eff 5-23-24",
